## Backend Module (CSED) – Per-Module Shape

Each `Backend/src/modules/{resource}/` follows:

```
modules/{resource}/
├── controllers/
│   └── {resource}.controller.ts
├── services/
│   └── {resource}.service.ts
├── entities/
│   └── {resource}.entity.ts
├── dto/
│   ├── create-{resource}.dto.ts
│   ├── update-{resource}.dto.ts
│   └── {resource}-response.dto.ts
├── enums/          (optional)
└── {resource}.module.ts
```

## Rules

- Add new source under the matching branch in the ASCII tree.
- Backend feature code lives under `Backend/src/modules/{resource}/` with the CSED subfolders above.
- Frontend feature code lives under `Frontend/src/` (pages, components, hooks, services, etc.) as in the tree.
- Do not create new top-level folders without aligning with this structure and project-structure standards.
